    <S id="blust-text-t01-s001" source="text 1, sentence 1; source printed pp. 246 (PDF pp. 256); English printed pp. 247 (PDF pp. 257)">
        <FORM kindOf="original">Numa ya pinudaqu iza kmalawa sa lhalhaushin, marutaw a lhalhaushin.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="original">numa ja pinudaqu iða kmalawa sa ɬaɬauʃin marutaw a ɬaɬauʃin</PHON>
        <FORM kindOf="standard">Numa ya pinudaqu iza kmalawa sa lhalhaushin, marutaw a lhalhaushin.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="standard">numa ja pinudaqu iða kmalaβa sa ɬaɬauʃin marutaw a ɬaɬauʃin</PHON>
