    <S id="blust-text-t01-s003" source="text 1, sentence 3; source printed pp. 246 (PDF pp. 256); English printed pp. 247 (PDF pp. 257)">
        <FORM kindOf="original">Muriut mashtay kmacu sa lhqaribush a sinapuk a lhqaribush a aqtalha, numa musún iutu mashtay kman aqtalha, numa ya itia sa pinigqilha tu caw a qilha ansunin isaháy yanan lhalhaushin miqilha.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="original">muriut maʃtaj kmaθu sa ɬqaribuʃ a sinapuk a ɬqaribuʃ a aqtaɬa numa musun iutu maʃtaj kman aqtaɬa numa ja itia sa piniŋqiɬa tu θaw a qiɬa ansunin isahaj janan ɬaɬauʃin miqiɬa</PHON>
        <FORM kindOf="standard">Muriut mashtay kmathu sa lhqaribush a sinapuk a lhqaribush a aqtalha, numa musun iutu mashtay kman aqtalha, numa ya itia sa piningqilha tu thaw a qilha ansunin isahay yanan lhalhaushin miqilha.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="standard">muriut maʃtaj kmaθu sa ɬqaribuʃ a sinapuk a ɬqaribuʃ a aqtaɬa numa musun iutu maʃtaj kman aqtaɬa numa ja itia sa piniŋqiɬa tu θaw a qiɬa ansunin isahaj janan ɬaɬauʃin miqiɬa</PHON>
        <TRANSL xml:lang="eng">Everyone brought game and crowded together to eat the meat, and if someone brought home-made wine they gathered at the swings to drink.</TRANSL>
